{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83c\udff4\u200d\u2620\ufe0f Chaotic Party Arr-cade Action for up to 12 players \ud83c\udff4\u200d\u2620\ufe0f</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Join two rival crews of up to 6 mates as you battle for supremacy on the high seas. Play locally or online, where teams try to steal treasure, defeat enemy captains, or sink ships to win matches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/Chaotic_Swashbuckling_Gameplay.png?t=1741477320\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/Victory_Types.gif?t=1741477320\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inspired by classic SNES games and modern couch co-op games, Plunder Panic blends retro graphics, arcade action, team-based strategy, and a boatload of  modify-arrs to keep even the crankiest pirates happy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/Plundering_for_up_to_12_players.png?t=1741477320\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/12_Players.gif?t=1741477320\" />Plunder Panic supports flexible team configurations with local, online, and AI-controlled players, making it perfect for casual parties and competitive play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/Unlock_Items_in_Solo_Campaign.png?t=1741477320\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/Campaign.gif?t=1741477320\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the treacherous, pirate-infested waters in campaign mode! Complete unique objectives across each island, unlocking new items, levels, and modify-arrs along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/18_Islands_to_Plunder.png?t=1741477320\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/Stage_Highlights.gif?t=1741477320\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Featuring 18 unique stages, each with dynamic, gameplay-altering effects! Dodge axe-throwing shopkeepers, spear-shooting Vikings, and even a ship-snapping kraken.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/Boatloads_of_Modifyarrs.png?t=1741477320\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/Items.gif?t=1741477320\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/Modifyarrs.gif?t=1741477320\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/Levels.gif?t=1741477320\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Want to add more panic? We have boatloads of game modes, items, and modify-arrs to play with. There are endless combinations to explore on our high seas!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/Cross-Platform_Support.png?t=1741477320\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/Online_Options.gif?t=1741477320\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/Ship_Goofin.gif?t=1741477320\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Have a crew on another platform? No problem! Plunder Panic features\u00a0<strong>crossplay</strong>\u00a0support across 10+ platforms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/Dangerous.png?t=1741477320\" />  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/Replayability.gif?t=1741477320\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Aspire to be the top pirate in the world? Swashbuckle the competition in ranked online matches! Or prefer to conquer yer couch? Retro-inspired player awards and stats keep you earning plunder to increase your sharable bounty poster!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/Treasure.png?t=1741477320\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Our coffers are starting to grow with indie acclaim!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">IndieCade Audience Choice Award, </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">PAX Rising Showcase winner, Official selection of the Indie MEGABOOTH </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Featured at SXSW, PAX East, PAX West, and PAX Rising Online</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Not sold yet, ye scurvy dog?</strong>\u00a0Our <strong>FREE DEMO\u00a0</strong>offers online matches (including crossplay) and the first 10 levels of the campaign.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Assemble yer crew, get all hands on deck, and send the scurvy competition to Davy Jones\u2019 Locker in Plunder Panic!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Getting Yer Sea Legs","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1455900/f694c5e92bff88938dcf084dddf89e7867c4165f.jpg"},{"name":"Glory to Ye","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1455900/03f9f4cf6dd90697c07861c86af0bbecf948361d.jpg"},{"name":"Seaworthy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1455900/76d65ec610850785b2dbf2b198aad8c361b8389a.jpg"},{"name":"Row Row Row Yer Boat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1455900/53cfcce52234569f8efd82d1c2eeaf830521b875.jpg"},{"name":"It's Booty-ful","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1455900/1763defae2b76ca8228888b20219adc52aa48263.jpg"},{"name":"Fire in the Hole","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1455900/1c176f51b1d934f0727325ea02b23973b9a2def0.jpg"},{"name":"I'm the Captain Now","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1455900/4de27322d38841d502c77cd3880d7f2d96ee466c.jpg"},{"name":"Taste of Victory","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1455900/8fc3dc5009fb686546ab2446e83ee49ba6776ec4.jpg"},{"name":"Victory on All Fronts","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1455900/e0b94a9f1c5bd1dadf627082350d3ceac72f8746.jpg"},{"name":"Naval Superiority","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1455900/cfb4ecc6cbe6a24896396eb687b93d77fbd9f2fc.jpg"}],"total":22},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1455900?t=1741477320","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741477320","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/c3994b4cb808a26a968d1418c58966cc4fb6ab26/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741477320","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/c3994b4cb808a26a968d1418c58966cc4fb6ab26/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741477320","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2300360,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83c\udff4\u200d\u2620\ufe0f Chaotic Party Arr-cade Action for up to 12 players \ud83c\udff4\u200d\u2620\ufe0f</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Join two rival crews of up to 6 mates as you battle for supremacy on the high seas. Play locally or online, where teams try to steal treasure, defeat enemy captains, or sink ships to win matches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/Chaotic_Swashbuckling_Gameplay.png?t=1741477320\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/Victory_Types.gif?t=1741477320\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inspired by classic SNES games and modern couch co-op games, Plunder Panic blends retro graphics, arcade action, team-based strategy, and a boatload of  modify-arrs to keep even the crankiest pirates happy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/Plundering_for_up_to_12_players.png?t=1741477320\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/12_Players.gif?t=1741477320\" />Plunder Panic supports flexible team configurations with local, online, and AI-controlled players, making it perfect for casual parties and competitive play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/Unlock_Items_in_Solo_Campaign.png?t=1741477320\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/Campaign.gif?t=1741477320\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the treacherous, pirate-infested waters in campaign mode! Complete unique objectives across each island, unlocking new items, levels, and modify-arrs along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/18_Islands_to_Plunder.png?t=1741477320\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/Stage_Highlights.gif?t=1741477320\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Featuring 18 unique stages, each with dynamic, gameplay-altering effects! Dodge axe-throwing shopkeepers, spear-shooting Vikings, and even a ship-snapping kraken.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/Boatloads_of_Modifyarrs.png?t=1741477320\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/Items.gif?t=1741477320\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/Modifyarrs.gif?t=1741477320\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/Levels.gif?t=1741477320\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Want to add more panic? We have boatloads of game modes, items, and modify-arrs to play with. There are endless combinations to explore on our high seas!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/Cross-Platform_Support.png?t=1741477320\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/Online_Options.gif?t=1741477320\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/Ship_Goofin.gif?t=1741477320\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Have a crew on another platform? No problem! Plunder Panic features\u00a0<strong>crossplay</strong>\u00a0support across 10+ platforms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/Dangerous.png?t=1741477320\" />  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/Replayability.gif?t=1741477320\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Aspire to be the top pirate in the world? Swashbuckle the competition in ranked online matches! Or prefer to conquer yer couch? Retro-inspired player awards and stats keep you earning plunder to increase your sharable bounty poster!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/Treasure.png?t=1741477320\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Our coffers are starting to grow with indie acclaim!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">IndieCade Audience Choice Award, </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">PAX Rising Showcase winner, Official selection of the Indie MEGABOOTH </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Featured at SXSW, PAX East, PAX West, and PAX Rising Online</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Not sold yet, ye scurvy dog?</strong>\u00a0Our <strong>FREE DEMO\u00a0</strong>offers online matches (including crossplay) and the first 10 levels of the campaign.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Assemble yer crew, get all hands on deck, and send the scurvy competition to Davy Jones\u2019 Locker in Plunder Panic!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p>","developers":["Will Winn Games"],"dlc":[2124030],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/header.jpg?t=1741477320","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright 2024 Will Winn Games, Inc.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.12 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 64-bit processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 2GB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong